/-!
# Vocabulary and arithmetic for the "flower" construction (`Work.EKLComp.flowers_exist`)

* `ivent a` — a bound for the inverse: `Uball U a ⊆ Uball U (ivent a)`;
* `FreeOn U C` — all points of `C` have trivial `U`-stabiliser;
* `SepOn U e C` — `e`-separation: no two points of `C` are related by an element of
  `Uball U e`;
* `collar U R C` — the `R`-collar `(Uball U R) • C ⊆ X₃`;
* `flowerSigma U R C W` — the σ-algebra generated by the collars over the slices `C ∩ W i`.
-/

